For easier bisection, add LoongArch DSDT.* to the allowed diff list.

This is a preparatory change for the subsequent patch that updates
the LoongArch ACPI tables (e.g., fixing UART description), which will
change the generated DSDT binaries. Allowing the diff now keeps the
bios-tables-test green while the actual table updates are reviewed.

